  "name": "careless_night",
  "description": "PLAYED BADLY ON PURPOSE, and the control for steady_hand. Same seed, same day, same opening settlement, same stock. This player adds four heated buildings and no generator, drops the one generator they own on bare ground where it joins no network, never builds a granary, a kitchen or a sorter, lays no belt, and answers the four wave warnings by placing a single turret after the attack has begun. Read it against steady_hand: every difference in the two state.json files was a decision, and the question this run asks is whether the interface said so at the time.",
